  "iid": 10183,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "GSM MAP: Fixed incorrect decoding of subscriberId in sendParameters",
  "description": "The field subscriberId was set to be decoded as SubscriberIdentity type, but in reality according to GSM 09.02 it has the type of SubscriberId. SubscriberId could be IMSI or TMSI, SubscriberIdentity could be IMSI or MSISDN, so Wireshark decoded TMSI as MSISDN leading to incorrect results.\nSince TMSI type definition is pulled in automatically by enabling the SubscriberId type I removed it from the template.",
